     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRImagingStudyLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRImagingStudyLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRImagingStudyLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMImagingStudy</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-dicom-examen-imagerie.html\">CDA - FR DICOM Examen imagerieversion: 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Act (FRCDADICOMExamenImagerie)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.header.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Act.id (Identifiant de l'entrée)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.modality</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Act.code.qualifier (Qualifier)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.bodySite</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Act ne porte pas de champ targetSiteCode (contrairement à Procedure/Observation) ; aucun attribut explicite identifié dans FRCDADICOMExamenImagerie pour bodySite.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.encounter</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune correspondance explicite identifiée dans FRCDADICOMExamenImagerie pour encounter.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.started</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Act.effectiveTime (Date de l'acte)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.basedOn</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune correspondance explicite identifiée dans FRCDADICOMTechniqueImagerie pour basedOn mais plutôt dans un autre contexte (demande d'imagerie).</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.numberOfSeries</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun attribut explicite identifié dans FRCDADICOMTechniqueImagerie pour numberOfSeries.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.numberOfInstances</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun attribut explicite identifié dans FRCDADICOMTechniqueImagerie pour numberOfInstances.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.studyCustodian</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune correspondance explicite identifiée dans FRCDADICOMTechniqueImagerie pour organisation.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.studyEndpoint</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune correspondance explicite identifiée dans FRCDADICOMTechniqueImagerie pour studyEndpoint. Les détails de l'endpoint sont portés par la ressource Endpoint cible dans FRCDADICOMSerieImagerie.entryRelationship:FRCDADICOMSOPInstanceObservation.text. .</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.series</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune correspondance explicite identifiée dans FRCDADICOMTechniqueImagerie pour series. Les détails de la série sont portés par la ressource FRCDADICOMExamenImagerie.entryRelationship.act:FRCDADICOMSerieImagerie.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMImagingStudy</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-imaging-study-document.html\">ImagingStudy - FR Imaging study Documentversion: 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ImagingStudy (FRImagingStudyDocument)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.header.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ImagingStudy.identifier (Study Instance UUID)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.modality</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ImagingStudy.modality (Modalité d'acquisition de l'acte d'imagerie)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.bodySite</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ImagingStudy.series.bodySite (Localisation anatomique en SNOMED CT)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMImagingStudy.encounter</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ImagingStudy.encounter (Encounter with which this imaging study is